{
  "title": "Warm Silky Argentinian Beef Broth",
  "description": "A comforting and savory Argentinian dish featuring rich beef stock, sweet candy, and a silky texture, perfect for a lazy Sunday, and is halal-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Argentinian",
